{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The\n kitchen\n-sink\n uses\n `@\ntext\n\n-field\n[name\n]` style\n\n. But\n\n for\n\n non\n\n-empty\n\n\n validation\n, I'll\n\n use\n\n\n the\n\n\n form\n0 approach\n\n\n with\n\n form\n\n+submit\n\n and\n\n\n validators\n, which\n\n automatically\n\n\n re\n\n-renders\n\n\n with\n\n error\n\n\n messages\n on\n\n\n failed\n\n\n validation\n. Let\n\n me\n\n write\n\n the\n\n study\n\n:\n\n```r\nacket\n\n#lang con\n\n\nscript\n\n(require con\nscript/form\n0)\n\n(pro\nvide\n benchmark\n-study\n)\n\n(defvar display\n-name)\n\n(define\n-values\n (name\n-form on\n-submit\n)\n  (form\n+submit\n\n   \n [display\n-name (ensure\n binding\n/text\n (required\n)\n (longer\n-than\n\n 0\n))]))\n\n\n(defstep (intro\n)\n  @md\n{#\n Welcome\n\n     \n Welcome\n to this\n short\n study\n. Click\n Continue\n to begin\n.\n\n      @button\n{\nContinue\n}})\n\n\n(defstep (ask\n-name\n)\n  (define\n (render\n rw\n)\n    @md\n{\n#\n What\n is\n your\n name\n?\n\n      @rw\n[\"\ndisplay\n-name\"\n (input\n-text\n \"Display\n name:\n\")]\n      @|\nsubmit-button\n|})\n\n  @md\n{@\nform\n[name\n-form on\n-submit\n render\n]})\n\n\n(defstep (final\n)\n  @md\n{#\n Thank\n You\n     \n Thank\n you\n, @display\n-name\n, for\n participating\n in\n this\n study\n.})\n\n\n(defstudy benchmark\n-study\n  [intro\n -->\n ask\n-name\n -->\n final\n]\n  [final\n -->\n final])\n```\n\nQuestion\ns\n:\n\n1. Is\n `\ninput-text`\n provided\n by\n conscript/form\n0?\n Earlier\n doc:\n \"@\ndef\nproc\n[(\ninput\n-text\n [label\n ...]\n) widget\n/c\n]\"\n — need to\n check\n which\n module\n. Line\n 973\n of\n con\nscript-reference\n; check\n context\n — it\n was\n in\n the Form\n0 section\n? Let\n me\n check\n around\n line\n 973\n and\n what\n module\n exports it\n.\n\n2\n. `@rw\n[\"\ndisplay\n-name\"\n ...]` — the\n render\n widget\n function\n takes\n a\n name\n matching\n the\n child\n key\n (the\n symbol\n). In form\n